(4, 'team', 'Team - Tero', 'Terodesign studio. Our team.', '3D, visualization, terodesign, studio, exterior, archviz, archvis, interior, cgi, render, rendering, design, cgartist, architecture, designer, concept, realestate, estate, service, portfolio, team', '<p>We are Terodesign - an architectural visualization studio with many years of experience, hundreds of happy clients, and thousands of created visualizations. We have created commercial and non-commercial visualization for projects around the world and we are very proud of that. We try not only to fulfill all the wishes of the client when working on a project but also to put a piece of our soul into every picture we make. And we truly hope that this can be seen in all our visualizations.</p>'),
